WEBVTT

00:00:14.445 --> 00:00:15.504
(SIGHS)

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:16.920
(SIGHS)

00:00:19.104 --> 00:00:20.841
Kids eat free on Tuesdays.

00:00:30.763 --> 00:00:31.904
Yay, Pop!

00:00:32.599 --> 00:00:33.641
MARGO: That's awesome!

00:00:35.816 --> 00:00:39.334
-So good to see you again, mi compadre!
-Ha! Yeah.

00:00:39.593 --> 00:00:41.654
Oh, I see you have already met my father.

00:00:42.453 --> 00:00:44.110
What? Father?

00:00:44.243 --> 00:00:47.667
Sí. Look at this crazy
small world we live in, eh?

00:00:48.012 --> 00:00:49.964
Come, sit, let me get you something.

00:00:50.089 --> 00:00:51.549
(CLUCKING ANGRILY)

00:00:51.902 --> 00:00:53.399
Oh, look at you. Heh?

00:00:53.703 --> 00:00:55.052
(LAUGHS NERVOUSLY)

00:00:55.297 --> 00:00:57.842
-He likes me.
-(SCREAMS)

00:00:57.935 --> 00:01:01.514
Oh, oh! I'm sorry.
Pollito is usually very friendly.

00:01:02.347 --> 00:01:03.769
He had a rough night.

00:01:06.021 --> 00:01:07.022
(LAUGHS NERVOUSLY)

00:01:07.459 --> 00:01:10.067
Well, we really should be going.
Girls, come on.

00:01:10.234 --> 00:01:11.902
That is a pity.

00:01:12.027 --> 00:01:14.655
Young love is beautiful, no?

00:01:14.822 --> 00:01:15.987
No! (CHUCKLES NERVOUSLY)

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:19.240
You know, they're not in love.
They hardly know each other.

00:01:20.683 --> 00:01:22.445
You are right, Cabeza de huevo.

00:01:22.698 --> 00:01:25.117
They must get to know each other better!

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:29.356
Antonio, why don't you invite
your girlfriend and her family

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.021
to our Cinco de Mayo party?

00:01:31.065 --> 00:01:32.286
No, no.

00:01:32.429 --> 00:01:34.094
BOTH: Sí!

00:01:48.529 --> 00:01:50.316
I'm sorry, El Macho?

00:01:50.679 --> 00:01:52.473
Hadn't we eliminated him as a suspect

00:01:52.730 --> 00:01:54.942
after the whole salsa incident?

00:01:55.025 --> 00:01:57.364
Yes, but there has been a new development,

00:01:57.408 --> 00:02:00.284
and I'm telling you, this is the guy.

00:02:00.659 --> 00:02:03.003
You need to arrest him immediately.

00:02:03.037 --> 00:02:06.225
And his deviously charming son!

00:02:06.639 --> 00:02:09.418
I'm pretty sure that
the son is involved, too.

00:02:09.672 --> 00:02:12.027
The son, also! You got to get the son!

00:02:12.764 --> 00:02:15.655
I think that the son is the mastermind!

00:02:16.148 --> 00:02:18.569
There's a look, there's a devilish look

00:02:18.692 --> 00:02:20.111
in his eyes, and I don't like it!

00:02:20.194 --> 00:02:22.181
Yes, but I don't really see any evidence.

00:02:22.228 --> 00:02:23.896
Evidence, schmevidence. I go with my gut,

00:02:23.959 --> 00:02:27.937
and my gut tells me that
this guy is El Macho.

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:30.397
Lock him up, lock up the son.

00:02:30.763 --> 00:02:34.167
Don't forget about the son.
The kid gives me the creeps!

00:02:34.823 --> 00:02:36.612
Oh, dear, oh, dear, oh, dear.

00:02:37.427 --> 00:02:41.700
But, on the less (WHISTLES)
crazy side of things,

00:02:42.449 --> 00:02:45.079
Gru discovered traces of the serum
at Eagle Hair Club!

00:02:45.663 --> 00:02:47.248
Hmm, interesting.

00:02:47.493 --> 00:02:49.675
Yeah! And you know
who made that happen? Huh?

00:02:50.008 --> 00:02:53.087
This guy. Nailed it. Amazing, right?

00:02:53.212 --> 00:02:56.966
No, I mean, sure.
But it's not him, it is El Macho!

00:02:57.091 --> 00:02:58.968
Mr. Gru, please!

00:02:59.066 --> 00:03:01.929
No! It is him, and I will prove it!

00:03:03.727 --> 00:03:05.558
Gru, come on!

00:03:07.101 --> 00:03:08.185
(CHUCKLING NERVOUSLY)

00:03:08.479 --> 00:03:10.229
He really thinks it's El Macho.

00:03:11.573 --> 00:03:12.723
Can you tell?

00:03:27.288 --> 00:03:28.289
(GASPS)

00:03:32.251 --> 00:03:33.794
(CALLING IN MINIONESE)

00:03:37.172 --> 00:03:38.674
Oh. Whoo!

00:03:44.597 --> 00:03:45.639
♪ (SINGING HULA SONG IN MINIONESE) ♪

00:03:51.770 --> 00:03:52.813
(HOOTING JOYFULLY)

00:04:16.136 --> 00:04:17.171
Give me that!

00:04:24.136 --> 00:04:25.262
(GROANS)

00:04:25.387 --> 00:04:27.537
Kevin, the Wi-Fi's out!

00:04:28.852 --> 00:04:30.142
Kevin?

00:04:30.511 --> 00:04:32.651
Hey, Lance, where the heck is Kevin?

00:04:32.937 --> 00:04:34.021
(BLOWS RASPBERRY)

00:04:34.366 --> 00:04:38.240
All right, we need to revisit the number
of vacation days you guys get.

00:04:38.625 --> 00:04:40.426
I can't find anybody anymore.

00:04:41.994 --> 00:04:43.489
JILLIAN: Gru, it's Jillian!

00:04:44.740 --> 00:04:46.539
(GIGGLING) I've got good news!

00:04:46.965 --> 00:04:48.906
I have my friend Shannon here with me.

00:04:49.119 --> 00:04:51.168
I was thinking you two
could get some grub.

00:04:51.372 --> 00:04:54.667
You know, tear it up,
see what happens! (LAUGHS)

00:04:54.875 --> 00:04:55.876
Open up!

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:57.419
La, la, la, la, la, la, la...

00:04:57.703 --> 00:05:00.421
(WHISPERING) Agnes! Agnes,
tell Jillian I'm not here.

00:05:01.512 --> 00:05:02.675
Gru's not here.

00:05:02.941 --> 00:05:04.468
Are you sure?

00:05:04.683 --> 00:05:05.940
Yes, he just told me!

00:05:06.303 --> 00:05:08.207
(CRINGES) Mmm-mmm!

00:05:08.852 --> 00:05:10.676
I mean, no, he didn't just tell me.

00:05:10.933 --> 00:05:13.809
(LAUGHS) Agnes, where is Gru?

00:05:15.492 --> 00:05:17.278
He's putting on lipstick!

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:21.498
He's swatting at flies!
No! No!

00:05:21.702 --> 00:05:23.028
He's chopping his head off!

00:05:25.234 --> 00:05:26.976
He's pooping?

00:05:28.502 --> 00:05:30.244
I know you're in there, Gru!

00:05:30.407 --> 00:05:33.789
There's no way you're getting out of this!

00:05:39.378 --> 00:05:42.297
SHANNON: I have to tell you,
I was so nervous about tonight.

00:05:42.621 --> 00:05:44.964
I mean there's just so many phonies
out there!

00:05:46.588 --> 00:05:49.143
Yes, I hear you. (CHUCKLES)

00:05:49.995 --> 00:05:52.903
-Oh, so, do you work out?
- Well...

00:05:52.937 --> 00:05:55.853
(CHUCKLES) I mean, obviously, you don't,
but would you consider it?

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:59.523
Huh? Physical fitness
is very important to Shannon.

00:05:59.878 --> 00:06:01.520
As you can tell, right? Huh?

00:06:02.809 --> 00:06:04.056
-(GRUNTING)
-Ah.

00:06:04.099 --> 00:06:05.109
I can tell.

00:06:05.254 --> 00:06:06.321
Solid.

00:06:06.405 --> 00:06:08.907
We are in the restaurant, you know.

00:06:10.926 --> 00:06:12.244
Hi. Takeout for Lucy?

00:06:12.557 --> 00:06:13.954
Sure, just a sec.

